          "reviewer_session": "01a118ea-3923-70c2-acd9-0830602bde5f",
          "rationale": "With step size 1, the trapezoidal rule gives y_new=y+(e^x\u22123xy+e^(x_new)\u22123x_new\u00b7y_new)/2. Multiplying by 2 and collecting y_new terms yields (2+3x_new)y_new=e^x+e^(x_new)\u22123xy+2y. Division gives original option c (index 2) wherever the denominator is nonzero. The authentic worked solution agrees. Submitted option b was graded Incorrect; this is a derived source-backed judgment, not successful grading of option c. The stored new subscripts denote the same labels as the captured typeset subscripts.",
